# clang-format exclusions — THE ONLY PLACE THIS LIST LIVES.
#
# Three things read this file, so it is edited here and nowhere else:
#
#   .github/workflows/clang-format-check.yml   scripts/clang-format-exclude.sh --globs
#   .githooks/pre-commit                       scripts/clang-format-exclude.sh --filter
#   Extras/clang-format-all-win64/*.bat        reads it directly, as -I arguments
#
# Before this file existed the same list was written out three times, and the
# three copies had already drifted. Add a vendor directory here and nowhere else.
#
# FORMAT
#   source-root: <dir>   the project directory clang-format runs over, relative to
#                        the repository root. Exactly one line. Empty = repo root.
#   <path>               a path relative to that source root, no trailing slash.
#                        Excludes that exact file, or that directory and all of it.
#   # ...                a comment, on its own line. Blank lines ignored.
#
# Vendor and generated code only. If you are excluding something we wrote, fix
# the formatting instead.


